  "description": "<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"520\" data-start=\"166\">Founded in 2023, LaQuiins Boutique offers premium scented and wellness products inspired by nature and self-care. Our handcrafted collection includes scented candles, room sprays, diffusers, and body care essentials. Each product is made with non-toxic, eco-friendly ingredients to provide a unique sensory and olfactory experience.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"522\">🕯️ <strong data-end=\"546\" data-start=\"530\">Our Products</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"896\" data-start=\"549\">We offer a refined selection of scented and wellness products:<br data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"611\">✅ <strong data-end=\"647\" data-start=\"616\">Scented candles &amp; wax melts</strong> &ndash; Made with natural wax and inspired by iconic women.<br data-end=\"704\" data-start=\"701\">✅ <strong data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"706\">Room sprays &amp; diffusers</strong> &ndash; Infuse your space with luxurious scents, leaving no residue.<br data-end=\"799\" data-start=\"796\">✅ <strong data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"801\">Body care (LaQuiins Care)</strong> &ndash; Massage candles, lip balms, hand creams, and bath essentials.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"934\" data-start=\"898\">✨ <strong data-end=\"932\" data-start=\"904\">Why Become an Affiliate?</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"935\">💰 <strong data-end=\"969\" data-start=\"938\">Attractive commission rates</strong> on every sale made through your link.<br data-end=\"1010\" data-start=\"1007\">🌿 <strong data-end=\"1048\" data-start=\"1013\">Handcrafted, non-toxic products</strong>, perfect for eco-conscious customers.<br data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1086\">🎁 <strong data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1092\">Exclusive promotions and offers</strong> for your audience.<br data-end=\"1149\" data-start=\"1146\">📦 <strong data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1152\">Fast shipping and excellent customer service.</strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1231\" data-start=\"1205\">💵 <strong data-end=\"1229\" data-start=\"1212\">Payment Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1386\" data-start=\"1232\">✔ <strong data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"1234\">Generous commissions</strong> on confirmed sales.<br data-end=\"1281\" data-start=\"1278\">✔ Secure payments via &nbsp;bank transfer.<br data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1327\">✔ Payments processed weekly with a minimum threshold.</p>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1630\">🚀 <strong data-end=\"1674\" data-start=\"1633\">Ready to earn with LaQuiins Boutique?</strong> Sign up now and start sharing the magic of our products!</p>",
